        "event": "Heat Advisory",
        "headline": "Heat Advisory issued June 2 at 2:27AM AKDT until June 2 at 8:00PM AKDT by NWS Juneau AK",
        "description": "* WHAT...Temperatures 80 to 85 expected in areas away from the inner\nchannels and outer coast.\n\n* WHERE...City of Hyder, Ketchikan Gateway Borough, and Prince of\nWales Island.\n\n* WHEN...From 10 AM this morning to 8 PM AKDT this evening.\n\n* IMPACTS...Individuals not accustomed to these unusually hot\ntemperatures for this region may experience heat related illnesses.",
        "severity": "Moderate",
        "certainty": "Likely",
        "urgency": "Expected",
        "sender": "NWS Juneau AK",
        "effective": "2026-06-02T02:27:00-08:00",
        "expires": "2026-06-02T10:30:00-08:00",
        "areas": "Prince of Wales Island; Ketchikan Gateway Borough; City of Hyder",
        "category": "Met",
        "response": "Execute",
        "instruction": "Drink plenty of fluids, and check up on elderly and vulnerable\nrelatives and neighbors.\n\nTake extra precautions when outside. Wear sunscreen and light loose\nfitting clothing. Try to limit strenuous activities to early morning\nor evening. Take action when you see symptoms of heat exhaustion and\nheat ",
        "lat": null,
        "lng": null
      },
      {
